      "text": [
        "2708 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : فِي اَلْمُحْرِمِ يَشْهَدُ نِكَاحَ مُحِلَّيْنِ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ «لاَ يَشْهَدْ » ثُمَّ قَالَ «يَجُوزُ لِلْمُحْرِمِ أَنْ يُشِيرَ بِصَيْدٍ عَلَى مُحِلٍّ »."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2708 - Imam (as) said regarding a person in the state of ihram attending the marriage of those not in ihram: \"They should not witness it.\"\nThen Imam (as) said: \"It is permissible for a person in the state of ihram to point out game to someone not in ihram.\""
        ]
      }
